# UNDERDELVE: traps. The floor right of Mo's start is a trigger (a faint seam
# across its top is the only tell): step on it and a loose rock drops from
# the ceiling above. Keep walking and it misses; it stays where it lands, in
# the way back. Stop on the trigger and it kills. Jump over it and nothing
# happens. Other traps wait across the mine.
game underdelve
wait 15
expect px == 35
expect tile_3_1 == 65
hold RIGHT 60
expect deaths == 0
expect tile_3_1 == 46
expect tile_3_8 == 97
hold LEFT 40
expect px == 64
cheat newgame
wait 5
hold RIGHT 10
wait 60
expect deaths == 1
expect lanterns == 5
wait 120
expect state == 1
cheat newgame
wait 5
hold RIGHT+A 3
hold RIGHT 45
expect deaths == 0
expect tile_3_1 == 65
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 1 3 110 130
cheat clear_enemies
wait 5
expect tile_3_1 == 65
hold LEFT 60
wait 60
expect deaths == 1
